3. Access credentials
The SDK connects to the Pulsate services using credentials that Pulsate issues
through the Pulsate platform for a specific application. You may use those
credentials only in the application they were issued for. You must keep them
confidential and must not share them with any third party. You must not use
the SDK, or any part of it, to access the Pulsate services with credentials
not issued to you by Pulsate, or by any other means. Pulsate may revoke or
replace credentials in accordance with the Agreement.

